# PC card team-concord2 (TMODE-34 CONCORD on every team, BENCH-153): , all 46 teams, 16 fresh seeds from 6900, against the build before CONCORD shipped (ncn, tmnoconcord). Template: c2prep writes work/team-concord2-bb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
